  m_text: 'In the next few minutes you''ll be riding passenger-side on a journey
    through my mind, and my thoughts on <b><i>"HOW TO VR"</i></b>


    It''s a working
    title, but bear with me... If you''re familiar with navigating in VR, you can
    go ahead and look around, otherwise just press the button on the inside of your
    wrist and I''ll show you all you need to know!

'
