  m_text: "Woah-oh-oh, mischievious aren't we? Pressing buttons we aren't supposed
    to? To be fair, I didn't really give you many options, did I? \n\nHello there!
    Welcome to my <b><i>LABORATORY</i></b>. From obvious do's and don't's in movement
    handling to how rendering in only one eye can be advantageous, we've got it all!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
